  "text": "Magic Raksha Guide\n\n​\nIntroduction\nThis is an advanced guide which assumes a strong underlying knowledge of all mechanics and information presented in #raksha-basic.\n​\nPreset and Relics\n⬥ Magic \n\n​\nRotations\n⬥ Autocast \n⬥ Set  with  auto-fire rate to 1\n⬥  can be used for damage mitigation\n​\nWar's Retreat\ns \n​\nPhase 1-3\n(tc) r  +  +  →  →  +  →  →  →   →  +  (mid channel) → step back +  →  →  →  →  →   → (5t)  (cancel at 1.8s) →  →  →  →  →  (if needed)\n​\nPhase 4\n  →  →  (if reset) → improv with  →  (if adren allows)\n​\n~3s before  is off cd\n →  →  →  →   →  →  →  →  →  →   (if needed)\n​\nExample Kills\n⬥ Magic \n\n\n​\n      \n    ",
